**/target/
.env
# I think ** will match even if I ever (perhaps accidentally) move these folders outside the ./ of this .gitignore.
# because I do not want to bother running git-filter-repo again if I accidentally change the locations somehow. 
# I don't suppose there is any drawback, not really, to this ** usage.
**/rustls_acme_cache/
# Ignore everything in local_ssl except config files and README
**/local_ssl/*
!**/local_ssl/*.config
!**/local_ssl/README.md